<VI _name="lvai_icon_set_class_icon.vi" description="Set a .lvclass icon from a 32x32 PNG and save the class. The PNG is loaded into the carrier VI in memory (Set VI Icon from File, never saved), read back as image data (VI Icon.Get as Image Data) and written to the class with {LV.LVClassLibrary} Set Icon - the spelling NI's own LIBUIP_SetLibIconAndApplyToVIs.vi uses - then {LV.LVClassLibrary} Save. One error indicator per stage. Run with the project CLOSED - open, Set Icon answers Error 1562 and writes nothing. Measured 2026-10-08 on LabVIEW 2026 Q3 32-bit with labview-mcp 1.8.5 in a pilot project (a class with six members, project closed).">
